>- The selective pickup option as described previously on numerous
>  occasions.

Not sure exactly what this is... personally I want a better way to go through
sacks- just like the sack was another inventory list.

>- Make it so you can no longer wish for the more powerful artifacts.
>  (ie: Mjollnir, Excalibur, Stormbringer ).  Maybe give you a ordinary
>  war hammer/longsword/broad sword.  You should only be able to attain
>  these items through the normal channels (ie:sacrifice).
>  Perhaps make these guys have a 'personality'...

Personality- sure, if it can be coded. Other than that- NO. These are WISHES,
and are supposed to be able to do anything except get the Amulet. I'd prefer
a percentage chance (say 50:50) that a flat out no chance.

>- Add a brief note on the artifacts into the 'data' file so that if you
>  use the '/' command to id it, it'll tell you something about that

Good idea.

>- a scroll of identify should be able to identify whether or not an item
>  is corrosion resistant.

YES. Not having the characteristic rust-proof is a major problem. Someone
out there implemented a patch for this on his system- if he's reading this
(or anyone else that has such a patch) could you please send it to me?

